          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following pseudocode:<br/>declare a stack of characters<br/>while(there are more characters in the word to read)<br/>{read a character<br/> if a character is &#39;*&#39; then<br/>  pop the stack<br/> else<br/>  push the character into the stack<br/>}<br/>while(the stack is not empty)<br/> pop and write the poped character to the screen<br/>What is written to the screen for the input &quot;Go**odMorn**in***g&quot;?</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét đoạn giả mã sau:<br/>declare a stack of characters<br/>while(there are more characters in the word to read)<br/>{read a character<br/> if a character is &#39;*&#39; then<br/>  pop the stack<br/> else<br/>  push the character into the stack<br/>}<br/>while(the stack is not empty)<br/> pop and write the poped character to the screen<br/>Với đầu vào &quot;Go**odMorn**in***g&quot;, màn hình sẽ in ra gì?</p></div>",
